    "description": "In the first convocation ceremony of the university in Mombasa, Kenya, 30 nurses enrolled in Aga Khan University's Advanced Nursing Studies (AKU-ANS) Programme were conferred with the Kenya Registered Community Health Nursing Diploma.",
